# Line-ending policy for this project.
#
# The acceptance evidence binds source identity to SHA-256 digests recorded in
# config/flight_baseline.json, external_dependencies.lock.json and
# config/dependency_history/. Those digests are computed over the working tree,
# so the working tree must not depend on the machine's git configuration:
# Windows Git defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite every file to
# CRLF on a fresh clone and invalidate every recorded digest without a single
# source change. Pin LF in the working tree, matching ../Flight's policy.
* text=auto eol=lf
